NyxForge Bounty DEX mockup generator.
Generates docs/storyboards/out/bounty-dex-mockup.html

5 frames (P2P bounty exchange, Waku order book, Nym swap execution):
  1. Market Overview   -- browsable listings, filter/sort, 24h stats
  2. Listing Detail    -- bounty terms, judge status, price, implied yield, Make Offer
  3. Create Listing    -- upload .bounty, set price, listing expiry, broadcast via Waku
  4. Swap Execution    -- PTLC atomic swap steps, Nym routing indicator, countdown
  5. My Trades         -- active listings, trade history
"""
